Sun Aug 30 18:32:50 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Correct SPDX license to LGPL-2.1-only - upstream grants 2.1 only,
  there is no "or later" clause in any source file, README or
  debian/copyright
- Fix Source URL - GitHub archives by tag name, the old path 404s
- Declare pkgconfig(libiio) >= 0.9, the floor CMakeLists checks, so
  OBS holds the build rather than failing in configure
- Spec cleanup: drop Group tags, switch to %autosetup, wire up
  %check, normalise README.md line endings (shipped CRLF), drop
  stale "pro+" wording from the module description
- Explicitly require soapy-sdr: the automatic soname dependency pulls
  only libSoapySDR, so the module could be installed with no SoapySDR
  client - not even SoapySDRUtil - to reach it

